1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,860
NARRATION: "Three of the weirdest jobs in history!"

2
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,200
3 WEIRDEST JOBS IN HISTORY

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,100
1. THE HUMAN ALARM CLOCK

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,400
Workers paid people
to wake them up.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,200
They tapped on bedroom windows
every morning.

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,400
He was literally a
human alarm clock.

7
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:23,800
2. GROOM OF THE STOOL

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
His job was to assist the king
with his toilet.

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,400
Surprisingly, it was a
prestigious position.

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,600
He had rare private access
to the king.

11
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:41,300
3. THE SIN-EATER

12
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:44,400
According to old folklore,
people paid him to absorb
the sins of the dead.

13
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,400
He ate bread offered
during the funeral.

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
This was believed to transfer
the deceased's sins to him.

15
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,400
He carried the burden,
according to the legend.

16
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:05,000
WHICH JOB WOULD YOU CHOOSE?

